{"id":2110,"level":44,"name":"Мат в один хід (4)","group":"Практика","format":35,"description":"<p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>Is the opponentâs king vulnerable? Look for checkmate! Deliver checkmate by placing the king in check while controlling all its escape squares.</span></p><p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>Did you know that no chess piece can deliver checkmate alone? Even the queen cannot checkmate by itself, not even when the enemy king is in the corner. To deliver checkmate, multiple pieces must work together. Sometimes the checkmating piece needs protection. In other cases, multiple pieces cooperate to control all escape squares. Occasionally, an opponentâs piece might block their own kingâs escape.</span></p><p><br></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"8/pp3p2/2n3k1/3p2pn/6K1/1BPPB2P/P1P5/8 b - - 0 27","pgn":"{[%csl Re5][%evp 0,1,-29999,-30000]} 27... Ne5# * ","text":"<p>Позиція з унікальним шаблоном мату! Якщо перемістити чорного коня в центр, білі отримають шах, і всі поля шахівниці втечі будуть закриті.</p>","format":35},{"fen":"r2q1r2/ppp2p2/1b1p2kp/7N/4P3/5Q2/PP3PPP/R4RK1 w - - 0 17","pgn":"{[%csl Rf5][%evp 0,1,29999,-30000]} 17. Qf5# * ","text":"<p>Чорний король значно просунувся, і білі можуть скористатися цим, давши шах ферзу. Раптом королю немає порятунку.</p><p><br></p>","format":35}],"puzzles":[{"id":78035,"fen":"2q1r3/ppp3Rp/2n5/8/6Pk/8/PBP4P/2K2B2 w - - 0 26","pgn":"{[%csl Rf6][%evp 0,1,29999,-30000]} {[#]} {Q=1} 26. Bf6# * ","format":35,"texts":["Мат в 1!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78039,"fen":"3qk2r/6bp/2p3p1/1pB1p3/2B3P1/8/PP3RPP/3Q2K1 w - - 0 25","pgn":"{[%csl Rf7][%evp 0,1,29999,-30000]} {Q=1} 25. Bf7# * ","format":35,"texts":["Мат в 1!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78050,"fen":"7R/8/3p1rp1/4p1k1/4Pp2/5P1P/5PK1/8 w - - 0 56","pgn":"{[%csl Rh4][%evp 0,1,29999,-30000]} {[#]} {Q=1} 56. h4# * ","format":35,"